  description: "Apply these effects, in sequence, depending on the type(s) of \"Borrel\"
    monsters you control and in your GY. If you control a monster with 3000 or more
    ATK, your opponent cannot activate cards or effects in response to this card's
    activation.\r\n\u25CF Fusion: Banish 1 monster your opponent controls.\r\n\u25CF
    Synchro: Banish 3 random face-down cards from your opponent's Extra Deck, face-up.\r\n\u25CF
    Xyz: Banish 1 Spell/Trap your opponent controls.\r\n\u25CF Link: Banish up to
    3 cards from your opponent's GY.\r\nYou can only activate 1 \"Bayonet Punisher\"
    per turn."
